---
import ActionLink from '../components/ActionLink.astro';
import PhotoFrame from '../components/PhotoFrame.astro';
import { inquiryLabel, pages } from '../content/site';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout page="about">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="page-heading">
      <h1>Maia Gromadowski</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Founder &amp; Head Trainer <span aria-hidden="true">|</span> USDF Silver Medalist</p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <PhotoFrame
        slotName="about-maia-with-milena"
        sizes="(max-width: 688px) 90vw, (max-width: 1351px) 38vw, 495px"
        ratio="2 / 3"
        tone="clay"
        priority
      />
      <div class="bio">
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Maia Gromadowski is a professional dressage rider and trainer with competitive experience through the FEI levels. With a background in both hunter/jumper and dressage disciplines, she brings a well-rounded and open-minded perspective to her training.</p>
          <p>Maia's approach emphasizes patience, correct fundamentals, and individualized development, with a passion for bringing out the best in horses of all levels and temperaments. Equally dedicated to developing riders, she believes in creating a positive and engaging learning environment where confidence, understanding, and progress go hand in hand.</p>
          <p>Among her proudest accomplishments is developing her homebred mare, Milena, from the beginning of her training through FEI competition. Maia continues her own education under the guidance of Grand Prix rider and trainer Heather Mason, while pursuing her own competitive ambitions.</p>
          <p>Through MAG Dressage, Maia strives to develop confident, capable horses and riders while maintaining a genuine enjoyment of the sport.</p>
        </div>
        <ActionLink href={pages.contact.href}>{inquiryLabel}</ActionLink>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .subtitle span {
    margin-inline: 0.3em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.84fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    padding-bottom: var(--section-space);
  }

  .bio {
    padding-top: clamp(0rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .bio .prose {
    margin-bottom: 1.55rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 43rem) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .bio {
      padding-top: 0;
      border-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
